WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.163
Open your WhatsApp account, select Flows and open the Flow

00:00:06.163 --> 00:00:08.386
Under Data source, click Set up data source

00:00:08.386 --> 00:00:16.394
Choose Server and enter your endpoint's URL

00:00:16.394 --> 00:00:19.728
Click Save

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:25.240
Copy the signing secret now: it is shown only once

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:32.547
Lost it? Edit the source and issue a new signing secret
